      "transcript_text": "Okay: BMI works out to 20.2, temp 36.9 degrees. And height 162 centimetres, blood pressure 121 over 71, respiratory rate 15, weight 53 kilos, pulse is 68 beats a minute. Listening to the whole story, I'd lean towards carpal tunnel syndrome. Diabetic neuropathy is also on my list.",
